cff-version: 1.2.0
title: stanwasm
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: habakan
abstract: >-
  Stan probabilistic models compiled and sampled entirely inside the
  browser. Pure Rust, single ~466 KB WebAssembly bundle, embedded
  nuts-rs sampler, zero backend required. Implements a subset of the
  Stan language with Bayesian NUTS sampling for in-browser inference.
keywords:
  - bayesian-inference
  - stan
  - webassembly
  - nuts
  - rust
  - probabilistic-programming
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: 'https://github.com/habakan/stanwasm'
version: 0.1.0
date-released: '2026-08-28'
